<title>UK: Banco Credibanco sets $100 mln 8-year step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Banco Credibanco sets $100 mln 8-year step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO CREDIBANCO</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY   *15.AUG.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    15.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+195 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    *CALL AND PUT OPTIONS AT PAR ON 15.AUG.00 AND</p>
<p>	     AT PAR ON 15.AUG.02</p>
<p>	    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    37.5	SELL CONC   12.5</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
